WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.747
The core message is simple.

00:00:01.827 --> 00:00:08.177
Do not expect larger or more expressive graph
neural networks to automatically give trustworthy

00:00:08.257 --> 00:00:11.290
confidence estimates under distribution shift.

00:00:11.370 --> 00:00:15.554
Instead, adapt the principle of stochastic
anchoring to graphs.

00:00:15.634 --> 00:00:21.103
G-Delta-UQ is a flexible, scalable, single-model
framework that produces reliable,

00:00:21.183 --> 00:00:26.720
well-calibrated uncertainty across structural,
size, concept, and covariate shifts,

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:32.270
and its pretrained variant makes it inexpensive to
add to models you already have.
